{
  "info": {
    "name": "SMD Vital - Microservices API",
    "description": "Colección completa de endpoints para la plataforma de servicios médicos domiciliarios SMD Vital.\n\n## Servicios Incluidos\n- **Authentication Service** - Autenticación y autorización\n- **Users Service** - Gestión de usuarios y perfiles\n- **Appointments Service** - Citas médicas\n- **Medical Records Service** - Historiales médicos\n- **Payments Service** - Pagos y facturación\n- **Notifications Service** - Notificaciones multi-canal\n\n## Variables de Entorno\nConfigura las siguientes variables:\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:8000\n- `authToken`: Token JWT obtenido del login\n- `userId`: ID del usuario autenticado\n- `patientId`: ID de un paciente\n- `appointmentId`: ID de una cita\n\n## Flujo de Autenticación\n1. Ejecutar **Register** o **Login**\n2. Copiar el `access_token` de la respuesta\n3. Configurar la variable `authToken` con el token\n4. ¡Listo para usar todos los endpoints!",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "patientId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "appointmentId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication Service",
      "description": "Endpoints para autenticación y autorización de usuarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('authToken', response.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('userId', response.user_id);",
                  "    pm.test('Registration successful', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(response.access_token).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"MiPassword123!\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Pérez\",\n  \"phone\": \"+573001234567\",\n  \"role\": \"patient\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Registrar un nuevo usuario en el sistema"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('authToken', response.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('userId', response.user_id);",
                  "    pm.test('Login successful', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(response.access_token).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"MiPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Iniciar sesión y obtener token JWT"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Obtener información del usuario autenticado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Renovar token de acceso"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Cerrar sesión e invalidar tokens"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
